From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:46:45 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 286/297] Meridian: an agent uploads through the site's own
 button when the page has no file field

upload_file with nothing named on a page with no <input type=file> asks
the person as before (same per-file confirmation and Settings > AI > File
uploads policy, "Always on <site>"), then offers the approved file to the
tab's next file chooser for 30 seconds and tells the agent to click the
site's upload button now. An input created on click or showOpenFilePicker
gets the file instead of the native dialog. Declined or turned off: nothing
is offered. Test switches: --meridian-test-cancel-file-choosers (no native
dialog in tests), --meridian-test-upload-offer-seconds.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
